## EXPERIMENTAL: BiliBili PCDN opt-in reject; DISABLED in both templates.
## version: 0.1.0
## updated: 2026-11-07
## Loaded with force-policy=reject and inserted-resource=true only when opted in.
## Blocking these domains can break BiliBili TV/Live or cause retry stalls.
## Do not enable unless a specific bad PCDN hostname is observed in QX logs.
## Turn it back off if playback, live or BiliBili TV stops working.
## IP:port-based PCDN cannot be reliably handled by hostname-only rules.

HOST-SUFFIX,mcdn.bilivideo.cn,reject
HOST-SUFFIX,mcdn.bilivideo.com,reject
HOST-SUFFIX,v1d.szbdyd.com,reject
